  "idea": "Notion 3.0 workspace automation updates and native database triggers",
  "text": "Notion just released their biggest automation update of the entire year. Operations managers waste hours updating project statuses, pinging teammates on Slack, and duplicating database rows. Manual board maintenance causes missed task handoffs and messy discrepancies across client roadmaps. Notion\u2019s native triggers now auto-assign owners, update linked child properties, and send customized Slack alerts the moment statuses switch. Your workspace runs autonomously without third-party connector costs.",
